It is Friday evening and my work for this week is finished.
I pack my laptop into the backpack and leave the office.
The weather forecast was very good this morning.
That is why I rode my bicycle to work today.
Normally I almost always travel by U-Bahn.
I am standing outside now and unlock the bicycle.
The sun is still high in the sky and shines brightly.
The light in the streets is wonderfully golden.
Berlin is very lively in the summer.
Many people are sitting outside in front of the restaurants.
I start riding slowly and enjoy the warm evening.
After the long week in the office, the exercise feels really good.
The gentle breeze from riding is pleasant on the skin.
I am in absolutely no hurry on the way home.
The ride to my flat takes a little longer today.
But this relaxed journey is the perfect start to the weekend.
